OL,3,GNEWSAWoman uses own eating disorder to
OL,4,Ahelp others
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who nearly died from an eating
OL,7,Fdisorder has started sharing her story
OL,8,Fto help other young people affected by
OL,9,Fsimilar conditions.
OL,11,FHolly Jordas, 22, was 12 years old when
OL,12,Fshe began to struggle as she found
OL,13,Fpressures from being a dancer and from
OL,14,Fsocial media hard to cope with.
OL,16,FA year later admitted to hospital
OL,17,Fbecause her weight had become
OL,18,Fdangerously low and she stayed there
OL,19,Funtil she was 14 years old.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
