OL,3,GNEWSAWoman uses own eating disorder to
OL,4,Ahelp others
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolly and her mother, Carole, were
OL,7,Fhelped during this time by Jersey
OL,8,FEating Disorder Support (JEDS), and
OL,9,FHolly said: "I owe my life to them."
OL,10,FShe added she continued to struggle but
OL,11,Fwas now managing to lead a healthier
OL,12,Flifestyle by focusing on exercise as a
OL,13,Fpersonal trainer.
